        {
          "id": "msg_1778242490620_xiooa2592",
          "role": "STUDENT",
          "content": "When did these symptoms first start, and were they sudden or gradual?",
          "isIntervention": false,
          "createdAt": "2026-05-08T12:14:50.620Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "msg_1778242506606_cnb4qi5pj",
          "role": "PATIENT",
          "content": "Well, doctor, that's a really good question, and it's not a simple answer. It's not like these symptoms just appeared overnight. Honestly, it feels like I've been dealing with aspects of this my whole life, though they've certainly gotten worse and more noticeable over time.\n\nWhen I was a kid, everyone just thought I was incredibly flexible – \"double-jointed\" they'd call me. I could bend my fingers and thumbs back in ways other kids couldn't, and I was always doing the splits in gym class without much effort. My skin, I remember, always felt a bit... stretchy, even then. And I bruised incredibly easily; my shins always looked like a war zone, even from minor bumps. So, those initial signs, like the flexibility and bruising, they were definitely there from childhood.\n\nThe joint dislocations, those started becoming more noticeable in my teens and early twenties. My shoulders and knees were the main culprits. They'd just pop out of place sometimes, doing something as simple as reaching for something or stepping awkwardly. At first, it was just an occasional annoyance, but they've definitely become more frequent over the years.\n\nAnd the pain... that's been a more gradual escalation. It wasn't until my late twenties, early thirties, that it truly became a *chronic* issue. Before that, it was just aches and stiffness after a lot of activity. But now, it's a persistent, deep ache in my hips, knees, shoulders, and back almost daily. It's definitely gotten steadily worse over the past two decades. So, the underlying tendencies were always there, but the severity and the constant pain have certainly developed and intensified gradually over many, many years.",
          "isIntervention": false,
          "createdAt": "2026-05-08T12:15:06.606Z"
        }
      ]
